{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"report_supported\": \"partly\",\n  \"judge_supported\": \"yes\",\n  \"report_quotes\": [\n    \"Low beta band decoupling is impaired in FoG-Turns compared to Reg-Turns\",\n    \"Decoupling failure of pathological beta bursts in FoG-Turns\",\n    \"Enhancement and attenuation of theta power across locomotor states\",\n    \"FoG-Turns showed decreased theta activity compared to Regular Walking (P = 0.029).\",\n    \"the significant decrease in peak theta power during FoG-Turn compared to Regular Walking was preserved (P < 0.001).\"\n  ],\n  \"judge_quotes\": [\n    \"The role of subthalamic theta activity during turning\",\n    \"FoG-Turns showed decreased theta activity compared to Regular Walking (P = 0.029).\",\n    \"the significant decrease in peak theta power during FoG-Turn compared to Regular Walking was preserved (P < 0.001).\",\n    \"Compared to regular walking, we found significant differences in theta power differentiating regular turning from freezing states and their preceding transitions.\"\n  ],\n  \"why\": \"报告的说法部分有依据：论文确实重点讨论了低 beta 活动异常及 beta burst 持续时间变化，相关结果分别有独立的小节。但报告说法中关于没有 STN theta 结果的部分与全文不符。论文第 7 页 Results 明确设有“Enhancement and attenuation of theta power across locomotor states”小节，报告 FoG-Turn 相较 Regular Walking 的宽频 theta 功率显著下降（P=0.029），峰值 theta 功率也显著下降（P<0.001）。第 8 页 Discussion 更专门设置“The role of subthalamic theta activity during turning”小节，明确讨论这一结果。因此，指控者对原文的描述得到全文直接支持。需要区分的是，低 beta 和 beta burst 确实是论文的重要研究结果，但并非论文报告的全部神经振荡结果。如果报告只是选择不在第 2.3 节讨论 theta，单凭论文全文不能核实报告章节的实际内容；但如果其表述意在声称原论文没有报告 STN theta 结果，则这一说法不成立。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "da7822eb-0fa0-40f7-996c-bddbcea16887", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070532776517Z", "elapsed_seconds": 171.641, "completed_utc": "2026-11-14T07:08:24.428362+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "5003aed3fc88863ca6e78c674a1ce6ed550c3f892dd4db616d6d3748e98346b2", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261114T070532776517Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "5f5ae96b7763e579c3ec7d67a3281dd65b659ff5074551c6c773bfd542e552f5"}}}
